<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ shares take second successive dive at close.</title>
<headline>NZ shares take second successive dive at close.</headline>
<text>
<p>* NZ share market falls steeply for second successive day</p>
<p>* Telecom, Brierley lead market down</p>
<p>* Index fall exaggerated by Fletcher, Air NZ going ex div ---------------------------(Oct 29)-----------------------------</p>
